in the Buy Box on Amazon and Walmart with intelligent repricing. Simple setup, powerful automation. Start repricing in 60 seconds.","url":"https://ecomcircles.com/software/repricer/","provider":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Ecom Circles","url":"https://ecomcircles.com"}}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CollectionPage","name":"Repricer: Win the Buy Box on Amazon, Walmart & Beyond","description":"Intelligent repricing that protects your margins while maximizing Buy Box share across every marketplace.","url":"https://ecomcircles.com/software/repricer/","breadcrumb":{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://ecomcircles.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Software","item":"https://ecomcircles.com/software/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Repricer","item":"https://ecomcircles.com/software/repricer/"}]}}</script><section class="pg-hero bg-shades"><div class="pg-hero__inner"><nav class="pg-crumbs"><a href="index.php">Home</a><span class="pg-crumbs__sep">›</span><a href="software.php">Software</a><span class="pg-crumbs__sep">›</span><span class="pgx-1">Repricer</span></nav><h1 class="pg-hero__title">Repricer: Win the Buy Box on Amazon, Walmart &amp; Beyond</h1><p class="pg-hero__tag">Intelligent repricing that protects your margins while maximizing Buy Box share across every marketplace.</p><p class="pgx-2">The Buy Box drives over 82% of Amazon sales, but the rules changed in November 2025. Amazon&#x27;s new algorithm now weighs delivery speed at 25-30%, dropping price weight to 20-25%. That means the cheapest price no longer wins automatically. Repricing in 2026 requires intelligence: knowing when to compete on price, when to hold margins, and how delivery speed factors into your Buy Box rotation. Our repricer handles all of this across Amazon and Walmart from one dashboard.</p><div class="pg-hero__cta"><a href="pricing.php" class="gradient-bg shadow-btn pg-btn">Start Repricing Free<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-3 lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="pg-btn pg-btn--ghost" href="software.php">See All Software</a></div></div></section><section class="pg-sec pg-sec--alt"><div class="pg-wrap-3xl"><div><h2 class="pg-h2 pg-mb-8">The 2026 Buy Box Algorithm: What Changed</h2><div class="pgx-4"><p>In November 2025, Amazon fundamentally restructured how the Buy Box rotates. For years, the algorithm was straightforward: lowest price wins. But that created race-to-the-bottom dynamics that hurt sellers and customer experience. The new algorithm is more balanced, and much more favorable to FBM sellers with fast shipping.</p><div class="pgx-5"><div><h3 class="pgx-6">Delivery Speed: 25-30% Weight</h3><p class="pgx-7">Sellers shipping within 1-2 days now compete head-to-head with FBA. If your delivery is as fast as FBA, the algorithm rotates you into the Buy Box rotation even if you&#x27;re slightly higher priced.</p></div><div class="pgx-8"><h3 class="pgx-6">Price: 20-25% Weight (Down from 50%)</h3><p class="pgx-7">Price still matters, but it&#x27;s no longer the deciding factor. You don&#x27;t need to match the lowest price to win rotations. Being within a &quot;fairness threshold&quot; (typically 5-15% above lowest) keeps you competitive.</p></div><div class="pgx-8"><h3 class="pgx-6">Seller Metrics &amp; Performance: 15-20% Weight</h3><p class="pgx-7">Feedback rating, defect rate, late shipment rate, and return rate now heavily influence rotation. A seller with 4.8+ stars and clean metrics wins rotations over cheaper competitors.</p></div><div class="pgx-8"><h3 class="pgx-6">The &quot;Fairness Threshold&quot;</h3><p class="pgx-7">Amazon penalizes extreme undercutting. If the lowest-priced offer is $20 and you&#x27;re at $35, the algorithm may skip you for Buy Box rotation. But if you&#x27;re at $20.50-$22.50, you stay competitive. Pure price-matching repricing is dead.</p></div></div><p class="pgx-9"><strong>What This Means for Repricing:</strong> Your repricer must be smart. It needs to factor in your fulfillment method, delivery speed, seller metrics, and market conditions. Blindly matching the lowest price guarantees margin erosion. Our repricer optimizes repricing for the post-November 2025 algorithm, helping you win Buy Box rotations without sacrificing profit.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pg-sec pg-sec--base bg-shades"><div class="pg-wrap-3xl"><div><h2 class="pg-h2 pg-mb-8">Repricing in Your Workflow</h2><div class="pgx-10"><p>Repricing works best when coordinated with inventory management. <a class="pg-link" href="inventory-management.php">Coordinate with inventory</a> to adjust repricing rules based on stock levels. After establishing your business, <a class="pg-link" href="buy-amazon-seller-account.php">reprice after launch</a> to stay competitive from day one. Use repricing as part of comprehensive <a class="pg-link" href="amazon-management.php">repricing in management</a> to maintain consistent Buy Box presence across your portfolio.</p><p>For Walmart sellers, our dedicated <a class="pg-link" href="walmart.php">Walmart repricer</a> is built around the Walmart Buy Box algorithm specifically, and is also available as part of <a class="pg-link" href="walmart-management.php">Walmart repricing included</a> in our management services for centralized control across both marketplaces.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="benefits" class="pg-sec pg-sec--alt"><div class="pg-wrap-3xl"><div><h2 class="pg-h2 pg-mb-8">Why Repricing Matters</h2><div class="pgx-11"><div><h3 class="pgx-12">Wholesale Seller with 2,000 SKUs</h3><p class="pgx-13">Manual repricing is physically impossible at scale. You can&#x27;t check 2,000 SKUs daily, let alone hourly. Our repricer automates this. Every SKU reprices based on competitors and your profit floor. Reprice continuously to maintain competitive Buy Box positioning.</p></div><div><h3 class="pgx-12">RA Seller with 300 Competitive SKUs</h3><p class="pgx-13">In electronics, toys, and home goods, prices change hundreds of times per day. Your SKUs can drop from Buy Box winner to 5th place in 2 hours if you&#x27;re not repricing. Our repricer runs 24/7, keeping you competitive and in rotation around the clock.</p></div><div><h3 class="pgx-12">Multi-Channel Seller (Amazon + Walmart)</h3><p class="pgx-13">Walmart&#x27;s algorithm explicitly checks Amazon prices. If you&#x27;re $2.99 on Amazon and $4.99 on Walmart, Walmart algorithm penalizes your visibility. Our repricer reprices each channel independently with its own rules and fees, letting you maintain competitive pricing across platforms while protecting margins.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="pg-sec pg-sec--alt"><div class="pg-wrap-3xl"><div><h2 class="pg-h2 pg-mb-8">How Our Repricing Works</h2><div class="pgx-11"><div><h3 class="pgx-14">Core Repricing Strategy</h3><div class="pgx-15"><p>We&#x27;ve redesigned repricing for the 2026 Buy Box algorithm. Instead of blindly matching the lowest price, our repricer is intelligent about when to compete and when to hold.</p></div><div class="pgx-16"><div class="pgx-17"><h4 class="pgx-6">Selective Competition</h4><p class="pgx-18">Choose which types of competitors to target. Focus on the sellers you can actually compete with. This keeps repricing focused on winnable Buy Box rotations instead of chasing unwinnable situations.</p></div><div class="pgx-17"><h4 class="pgx-6">Fee-Aware Repricing</h4><p class="pgx-18">Every repricing decision factors in current fees. January 2026 FBA fees increased by $0.08-$0.31/unit depending on category. Our repricer recalculates true profit margins with updated FBA fees, Walmart WFS fees, and referral fees. You&#x27;re not matching prices blindly. You&#x27;re matching based on real profit.</p></div><div class="pgx-17"><h4 class="pgx-6">Floor &amp; Ceiling Protection</h4><p class="pgx-18">Set minimum and maximum prices per SKU. Your repricer will never drop below your floor, even during price wars. If competitors are at $15 but your floor is $18, you hold at $18 and cede that round. The Buy Box rotates, and you&#x27;ll get another chance without destroying your margin.</p></div><div class="pgx-17"><h4 class="pgx-6">Get the Buy Box Strategy</h4><p class="pgx-18">Our live strategy: &quot;Get the Buy Box&quot; lets you set configurable actions for when you have the Buy Box and when it&#x27;s suppressed. Configure repricing behavior by category, supplier, or sales velocity. Additional strategies coming soon.</p></div><div class="pgx-17"><h4 class="pgx-6">Multi-Channel Repricing</h4><p class="pgx-18">Reprice Amazon and Walmart from one dashboard. Each channel gets its own rules, fees, and thresholds, repriced independently. Use our <a class="pg-link" href="walmart.php">Walmart repricing tool</a> for advanced multi-channel strategies. <a class="pg-link" href="mirakl.php">Mirakl repricing</a> coming soon.</p></div></div></div><div class="pg-card"><h3 class="pgx-19">Get Started in 60 Seconds</h3><ol class="pgx-20"><li class="pgx-21"><span class="pgx-22">1.</span><span>Connect your Amazon or Walmart account via OAuth (one click)</span></li><li class="pgx-21"><span class="pgx-22">2.</span><span>Set your minimum profit margin and upload your SKU list</span></li><li class="pgx-21"><span class="pgx-22">3.</span><span>Choose a strategy template or customize by category</span></li><li class="pgx-21"><span class="pgx-22">4.</span><span>Enable repricing and watch your Buy Box performance improve</span></li></ol><p class="pgx-23">Most sellers see results within 24 hours. No complex rules, no spreadsheets, no waiting.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="pg-sec pg-sec--base bg-shades"><div class="pg-wrap-3xl"><div><h2 class="pg-h2 pg-mb-12">Why Ecom Circles Repricing</h2><div class="pgx-24"><div class="pgx-25"><h3 class="pgx-26">All-In-One Platform</h3><p class="pgx-27">Unlike standalone repricing tools, our repricer is part of Ecom Circles&#x27; complete seller platform. Scan products, run repricing, manage inventory, and optimize PPC all from one dashboard. Everything integrates seamlessly. Your data flows, not your workflow.</p></div><div class="pgx-25"><h3 class="pgx-26">Multi-Channel Built In</h3><p class="pgx-27">Amazon and Walmart repricing in one place. No separate subscriptions, no switching between tools. Reprice independently on each channel with fees calculated automatically.</p></div><div class="pgx-25"><h3 class="pgx-26">Constantly Improving</h3><p class="pgx-27">Our repricer is built for the 2026 Buy Box algorithm. We&#x27;re actively building 3 additional strategies (Competitive, Profit Target, Velocity) and Mirakl repricing support. Mirakl repricing coming soon.</p></div><div class="pgx-25"><h3 class="pgx-26">Honest Framing</h3><p class="pgx-27">We don&#x27;t promise unrealistic results or hide limitations. Our repricer uses straightforward rules-based pricing optimized for the new algorithm. You get solid repricing as part of the platform you&#x27;re already using.</p></div><div class="pgx-25"><h3 class="pgx-26">Transparent Pricing</h3><p class="pgx-27">No separate repricing subscription required. All plans include repricing: Starter (500 SKUs), Growth (2,500 SKUs), Scale (10,000 SKUs), Enterprise (25,000+ SKUs). Pay one price for the entire platform.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="pg-sec pg-sec--alt"><div class="pg-wrap-5xl"><div class="pg-sec__head"><h2 class="pg-h2">Repricing Features</h2></div><div class="pgx-28"><div class="pg-card"><h3 class="pgx-12">Competitor Monitoring</h3><p class="pg-card__desc">Track competitors across multiple marketplaces. Selective competition lets you ignore non-viable sellers and focus on winnable Buy Box rotations.</p></div><div class="pg-card"><h3 class="pgx-12">Intelligent Price Optimization</h3><p class="pg-card__desc">Smart repricing rules optimized for the 2026 Buy Box algorithm. Factors in your fulfillment method, delivery speed, seller metrics, and profit margins.</p></div><div class="pg-card"><h3 class="pgx-12">Profit Floor Protection</h3><p class="pg-card__desc">Set minimum margins per SKU. We never reprice below your floor, protecting profitability even during price wars.</p></div><div class="pg-card"><h3 class="pgx-12">Multi-Channel Repricing</h3><p class="pg-card__desc">Reprice Amazon, Walmart, and Mirakl from one dashboard. Coordinated pricing across all channels prevents arbitrage and algorithm penalties.</p></div><div class="pg-card"><h3 class="pgx-12">Buy Box Intelligence</h3><p class="pg-card__desc">See current Buy Box status and win/loss reasons. Understand which competitors own rotation and when you enter/exit.</p></div><div class="pg-card"><h3 class="pgx-12">Selective Competition</h3><p class="pg-card__desc">Choose which sellers to compete against. Exclude Amazon, filter by rating, or ignore regional sellers. Focus on winnable rotations.</p></div><div class="pg-card"><h3 class="pgx-12">Fee-Aware Calculations</h3><p class="pg-card__desc">Updated with January 2026 FBA fee changes. Every repricing decision factors in your actual profit, not just price.</p></div><div class="pg-card"><h3 class="pgx-12">Historical Analytics</h3><p class="pg-card__desc">Coming soon: Track repricing impact over weeks and months. See which strategies maximize profit per SKU and optimize going forward.</p></div></div></div></section><?php
